1
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Melissa’s vacation just turned into a rescue mission.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Dadnapped is a comedy, adventure, action film directed by Paul Hoen.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Melissa has a bad case of sibling rivalry, only her competition is a fictional
character in her father's best-selling novel about a teenage super spy.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
When her father is "dadnapped" by a group of overzealous fans, it's up
to Melissa to help him by tapping her inner superhero.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Melissa Morris, played by Emily Osment.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Wheeze, played by David Henrie.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
Merv Kilbo, played by Jason Earles.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Neal Morris, played by George Newbern.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Maurice Legarche, played by Phill Lewis.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Debbie, played by Jennifer Stone.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Dadnapped is a 2009 American crime comedy film
released as a Disney Channel Original Movie.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
It premiered February 16, 2009.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Starring actors from Disney Channel Original Series, the
movie had 4.6 million viewers for its premiere.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
Although the story centers on a hostage situation, the kidnappers are
inept and the film "practically oozes kid-pleasing content".

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The tone is lighthearted.
